WEBVTT

00:00:29.183 --> 00:00:30.791
i preslikali smo njihovo ponašanje

00:00:30.791 --> 00:00:32.239
pri lovu iz vazduha.

00:00:32.239 --> 00:00:34.905
Dole levo je prikazan lav koji osmatra

00:00:34.905 --> 00:00:36.917
krdo impala za ulov,

00:00:36.917 --> 00:00:38.486
a desno je prikazano ono što nazivam

00:00:38.486 --> 00:00:40.349
lavljim vidokrugom,

00:00:40.349 --> 00:00:42.971
ili koliko lav vidi u svim pravcima

00:00:42.971 --> 00:00:47.146
dok njemu ili njoj
zelenilo ne zakloni pogled.

00:00:47.146 --> 00:00:48.587
Otkrili smo

00:00:48.587 --> 00:00:51.093
da lavovi mužjaci nisu lenji lovci

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:52.617
kao što smo mislili.

00:00:52.617 --> 00:00:54.754
Oni samo koriste različitu strategiju.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:56.506
Dok lavice love

00:00:56.506 --> 00:00:57.638
u savani na otvorenom,

00:00:57.638 --> 00:01:00.299
na dugim relacijama,
obično tokom dana,